    "chunk_text": "\u00e6dlice mislamp, hie angunnan hit witan heora latteowum & heora Ra\u00fee \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m hie b\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t hie mon to hiora earde forlete, \u00fe\u00e6t hie mosten gefandian hwe\u00f0er \u00dea him mon \u00fe\u00e6s forwiernde, \u00fea gesohton hie hie mid firde. On \u00fe\u00e6re heriunge gemette se ieldesta ladteow Macheus his agenne sunu mid purpurum gegieredne He hiene \u00fea for \u00fe\u00e6m girelan gebealg, & hiene oferfon het, & ahon; & wende \u00fe\u00e6t he for his Ra\u00fee \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m hie begeaton Cartaina \u00fea burg, & ealle \u00fea \u00e6lt\u00e6westan ofslogon \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6rinne w\u00e6ron, \u00dea \u00e6t nihstan he wear\u00fe self besiered & ofslagen. \u00deis w\u00e6s geworden on Ciruses d\u00e6ge Persa cyninges. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Himelco, Cartaina cyning, gefor mid firde an Sicili\u00e6, & him \u00fe\u00e6r becom swa f\u00e6rlic & he for \u00f0\u00e6m ege his unwillum \u00feonan wende, & ham for mid \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r to lafe w\u00e6ron. Sona swa \u00f0\u00e6t forme scip land gesohte, ond \u00fe\u00e6t egeslice spell gebodade, swa w\u00e6ron ealle \u00fea Mid \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee \u00fea burgware swa geomorlic angin h\u00e6fdon, \u00fea com se cyning self mid his scipe, & & \u00e6g\u00feer ge he self wepende hamweard for, ge \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fe\u00e6t him ongean com, eall hit him wepende & he se cyning his handa w\u00e6s uppweardes br\u00e6dende wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s heofones, & mid oferheortnesse him & he \u00feagiet him selfum gedyde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w",
